  "result": "Excellent! All 196 tests pass \u2713\n\n**Added VAT summary to src/reports.js**\n\n**New function:**\n- `vatSummary(invoices)` \u2014 aggregates VAT by rate across invoices\n  - Filters to 'issued', 'partially_paid', and 'paid' invoices only\n  - Groups by VAT rate\n  - For each rate, calculates:\n    - base: sum of (lineTotal - lineDiscount) for all lines at that rate\n    - vat: sum of lineVat() amounts (rounded per line) for all lines at that rate\n  - Returns array of { rate, base, vat }\n  - Sorted by rate descending (highest tax rate first)\n\n**Tests added: 13 tests covering**\n- Empty invoice list\n- Single issued invoice\n- Status filtering (excludes draft, includes issued/partially_paid/paid)\n- Aggregating multiple invoices with same VAT rate\n- Sorting by rate descending\n- Base calculation (correctly subtracts discounts)\n- Input immutability\n- Correct structure (3 fields: rate, base, vat)\n- Multiple lines per invoice aggregation\n- Products with different VAT rates",
